OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance service sees record 999
OL,4,Ademand
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ambulance service has seen record
OL,7,Fdemand in September with nearly 100,000
OL,8,Fcalls to 999, with staff attending more
OL,9,Fthan 84,000 emergency incidents.
OL,11,FIt compares to about 90,000 calls last
OL,12,FSeptember - 80,000 of which required an
OL,13,Fambulance response, said the East of
OL,14,FEngland Ambulance Service.
OL,16,FHigher demand had resulted in longer
OL,17,Fwaits for treatment. Last month, crews
OL,18,Fspent more than 18,000 hours waiting to
OL,19,Ftransfer patients into hospital care,
OL,20,Fit said.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
