OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance service sees record 999
OL,4,Ademand
OL,5,
OL,6,F"By improving patient flow through
OL,7,Fhospitals, and supporting people to
OL,8,Freceive care in the right place, we can
OL,9,Fhelp ambulances get back on the road
OL,10,Fmore quickly and respond to the next
OL,11,Fpatient in need," said chief operating
OL,12,Fofficer Darren Meads.
